{% comment %}
  Therapy booking — doctor + slot picker combined into ONE screen, no
  separate Doctor Select step. Per the user: for therapy/offline bookings
  there's normally only one doctor at a facility, so the doctor is just
  shown directly rather than picked from a list. Multi-doctor handling is
  an explicitly OPEN question, deferred — do not build a picker/fallback
  for it without being asked; this screen only needs to handle the
  single-doctor case for now.

  Always offline/in-clinic — no In-clinic/Video toggle here at all (the
  Figma export includes one, but marked display:none; omitted from this
  markup entirely rather than building a permanently-hidden dead toggle).

  Not yet wired into the main flow's navigation — there's no preceding
  "which facility" step and no defined next step after Continue yet.
  data-kal-back defaults to "entry" as a reasonable placeholder until the
  actual preceding screen is defined. Registered as its own step
  (data-kal-step="therapy-slot") so it's directly reachable for review/demo
  in the meantime.

  Deliberately NOT reusing .kal-step-slot-picker's class or JS state
  (slotPicker/renderDayStrip/etc.) — that JS is bound to a single specific
  element (flow.querySelector('.kal-step-slot-picker'), first-match only),
  so two screens sharing that class would fight over whose doctor/facility
  data actually gets used. This screen has its own small, separate state
  object (therapySlot) and render functions in kal-booking-flow.js, reusing
  only the pure date/formatting helpers (formatTime12h, toDateKey, etc.)
  that don't depend on which element is "the" slot picker.

  No day-strip slot-count badges here (unlike the Consultation Slot Picker)
  — the Figma export doesn't show them, and this screen skips the
  day-summaries fetch entirely rather than mimicking that UI.

  Doctor card uses real placeholder data matching the same doctor already
  used elsewhere as a placeholder (Neethu Jayachandran, Koramangala) — the
  Figma's own example doctor happens to match.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="kal-step-therapy-slot" data-kal-doctor-id="0f425bd1-9a69-4adc-a0a3-6f2b8ba87191" data-kal-facility-id="185b85d7-fad2-405d-b8ea-13dc683fbde8">

  {%- comment -%} ============ MOBILE ONLY (below 750px) ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="kal-step-therapy-slot__mobile">

    <div class="kal-therapy-slot__appbar">
      <button type="button" class="kal-step-doctor-select__back" data-kal-back="entry" aria-label="Back">
        {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'chevron-left' -%}
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="kal-therapy-slot__location">
        {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'location-pin' -%}
        <span>Indiranagar Clinic</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="kal-step-doctor-select__back" data-kal-close aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__intro">
      <h2 class="kal-step-doctor-select__heading">Book your consultation</h2>
      <p class="kal-step-doctor-select__subtext">Here&rsquo;s the doctor you&rsquo;ll see &mdash; just pick a time.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-therapy-doctor-card">
      <span class="kal-therapy-doctor-card__avatar">NJ</span>
      <span class="kal-therapy-doctor-card__info">
        <span class="kal-therapy-doctor-card__name">Dr. Neethu Jayachandran</span>
        <span class="kal-therapy-doctor-card__qualification">BAMS &middot; 9+ yrs</span>
        <span class="kal-therapy-doctor-card__specialization">Skin &amp; hair, infertility &amp; lifestyle</span>
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-slot-section">
      <div class="kal-slot-section__head">
        <p class="kal-slot-section__label">Date</p>
        <button type="button" class="kal-icon-button" data-kal-open-calendar aria-label="Open calendar">
          {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'calendar-days' -%}
        </button>
      </div>
      {%- comment -%} Populated client-side by renderTherapyDayStrip() in kal-booking-flow.js — no slot-count badges {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="kal-day-strip" data-kal-therapy-day-strip></div>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-slot-section">
      <p class="kal-slot-section__label">Available time</p>
      {%- comment -%} Populated client-side by renderTherapySlotPeriods() in kal-booking-flow.js {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="kal-slot-periods" data-kal-therapy-slot-periods>
        <p class="kal-slot-periods__empty">Loading available times&hellip;</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-step-slot-picker__footer">
      <button type="button" class="kal-step-doctor-select__continue" data-kal-therapy-continue disabled>
        Select a date and time
      </button>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>
